Inspiration
-----------

This project is an independent Rust implementation of the idea popularised by:

    snk - https://github.com/Platane/snk
    Copyright (c) 2021 Platane
    Licensed under the MIT License

The 3D contribution profile follows the same idea as:

    github-profile-3d-contrib - https://github.com/yoshi389111/github-profile-3d-contrib
    Copyright (c) 2021 SATO Yoshiyuki
    Licensed under the MIT License

No source code from those projects was copied into this repository. The
inspiration is limited to the concept (a snake crawling the GitHub
contribution graph, and an isometric 3D profile of the same calendar) and
the general visual language.

